---
title: "Lead a session — CTA Retreat 2026"
description: "Offer a talk, a discussion, or a story for the first Christian Transhumanist Retreat, October 16–18, 2026."
layout: default
permalink: /retreat/sessions/
body_classes: retreat-page
metaRobots: "noindex, nofollow"
---

<section class="retreat-section retreat-comp retreat-sessions">
  <div class="retreat-section__inner">

    <p class="retreat-hero__eyebrow">The First Christian Transhumanist Retreat</p>
    <h1>Lead a session</h1>

    <p class="retreat-comp__lede">Part of the weekend comes from the people in the room. If there's something
    you'd like to share or ask the group, tell us here. We'll fit as many as we can into the schedule and
    follow up before the retreat.</p>

    <form name="retreat-sessions" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          action="/retreat/sessions/thanks/" class="retreat-comp__form">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="retreat-sessions">
      <p hidden><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>

      <p>
        <label for="sess-name">Your name <span class="retreat-comp__req">required</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="sess-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="sess-email">Email <span class="retreat-comp__req">required</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="sess-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="sess-topic">Topic or title <span class="retreat-comp__req">required</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="sess-topic" name="topic" required>
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="sess-about">A sentence or two about it</label>
        <textarea id="sess-about" name="about" rows="3"></textarea>
      </p>

      <fieldset class="retreat-sessions__choices">
        <legend>How would you like to share it? <span class="retreat-comp__req">required</span></legend>

        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="format" value="Short talk (10 min, everyone)" required>
          <span><strong>A short talk to everyone</strong>
          About 10 minutes, with a question or two after.</span>
        </label>

        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="format" value="Lead a whole-room discussion">
          <span><strong>Lead a conversation with everyone</strong>
          You open with a question or a short framing, then guide the whole group's discussion.</span>
        </label>

        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="format" value="Lead a small-group breakout">
          <span><strong>Lead a small-group conversation</strong>
          People who choose your topic join you in a group of five or six, for about 45 minutes.</span>
        </label>

        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="format" value="Fireside story">
          <span><strong>Tell a story by the fire</strong>
          About 10 minutes on Saturday night: how you got here, or a story the group should hear.</span>
        </label>

        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="format" value="Other">
          <span><strong>Something else</strong>
          Tell us what you have in mind.</span>
        </label>
        <p class="retreat-sessions__other">
          <label for="sess-other">If something else, what?</label>
          <input type="text" id="sess-other" name="format-other">
        </p>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="retreat-sessions__choices retreat-sessions__av">
        <legend>Will you need any of these?</legend>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Slides (screen or projector)"> Slides on a screen or projector</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Video or audio playback"> Video or audio playback</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Microphone"> A microphone</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Whiteboard or flip chart"> A whiteboard or flip chart</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Printed handouts"> Printed handouts</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="av[]" value="Musical instrument or music setup"> A musical instrument or music setup</label>
        <p class="retreat-sessions__other">
          <label for="sess-av-other">Anything else?</label>
          <input type="text" id="sess-av-other" name="av-other">
        </p>
      </fieldset>

      <p>
        <label for="sess-notes">Anything else we should know?</label>
        <textarea id="sess-notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Timing, who it's for, whether you'd co-lead"></textarea>
      </p>

      <button type="submit" class="retreat-btn">Send it</button>
    </form>

    <p class="retreat-comp__fineprint">Friday, October 16 (check-in 4pm) &rarr; Sunday, October 18 (10am) &middot;
    Woodlands Retreat, Nunnelly, Tennessee. We'll confirm what equipment the lodge has once we know what people need.</p>

  </div>
</section>
